horrific culmination of a series of faulty&nbsp;
technical assumptions by Boeing's engineers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:22.560
a lack of transparency on the part of Boeing's&nbsp;
management, and grossly insufficient oversight&nbsp;&nbsp;

